{"page_id": "synth_copies-sv153d4cf7-p1", "markdown": "# US 20080222036A1\n\n(19) United States\n\n(12) Patent Application Publication\n\nASAT et al.\n\n(54) MOBILE TERMINAL\n\n(75) Inventors:\n\nMao ASAI, Kawasaki-shi (JP);\n\nShingo Sugimoto, Nagoya-shi (JP);\n\nNaoki Naruse, Yokohama-shi (JP);\n\nHisashi Yoshinaga, Yokohama-shi\n\n(JP); Kumiko Yamaguchi, Yokosuka-shi (JP)\n\nCorrespondence Address:\n\nOBLON, SPIVAK, MCCLELLAND MAIER & NEUSTADT, P.C.\n\n1940 DUKE STREET\n\nALEXANDRIA, VA 22314 (US)\n\n(73)\n\nAssignee:\n\nNTT DoCoMo, Inc., Tokyo (JP)\n\n12/043,677\n\n- Appl. No.:\n- Filed:\n\nMar. 6, 2008\n\n(30)\n\nForeign Application Priority Data\n\nMar.7、2007\n\n(P).\n\n2007-057618\n\nMOBILE TERMINAL\n\n-104\n\nAPPLICATION\n\nSTORAGE PART\n\n(10) Pub. No.: US 2008/0222036 A1\n\n(43) Pub. Date:\n\nSep. 11, 2008\n\nPublication Classification\n\n(5I) Int. CL.\n\nG06Q 90/00\n\n（52） U.S.C1.\n\n（2006.01）\n\n705/41\n\n(57)\n\nABSTRACT\n\nA mobile terminal capable of causing the user side to grasp whether or not a credit settlement service stops with a simple operation is provided. In the mobile terminal 10, validation and invalidation of a storage area within an IC chip assigned to an issuer application corresponding to one issuer are switched based on switching instruction information reecived from an issuer terminal 20 managed by one issuer. Then, when the issuer application starts, there is displayed in a lump whether or not the respective issuer applications are available on a display part 16, based on state information indicating\n\nrespective storage areas are validated. Therefore, in the mobile terminal 10, even if plural issuer applications are stored, it is possible to cause the user side to grasp which kind of the credit settlement service stops, with a simple operation of only starting a management application.\n\n20A(20)\n\n106 -\n\nSWITCHING INSTRUCTION\n\nECEPTION PART\n\nTORAGE AREA\n\nDISPLAY\n\nPART\n\nUPDATE PART\n\n16\n\nIC CHIP\n\nIC CHIP\n\n20B(20)\n\nISSUER TERMINAL\n\n20C(20)\n\nISSUER TERMINAL", "width": 1700, "height": 2200, "blocks": [{"kind": "heading", "text": "US 20080222036A1", "bbox": {"x": 971.428567610063, "y": 109.99999954166672, "width": 229.11051212938008, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(19) United States", "bbox": {"x": 210.7816708816854, "y": 146.66666661239034, "width": 339.0835579514824, "height": 41.2500000000001}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(12) Patent Application Publication", "bbox": {"x": 206.19946069274363, "y": 197.08333331348422, "width": 696.4959568733154, "height": 50.41666666666673}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "ASAT et al.", "bbox": {"x": 269.82312315545045, "y": 247.02088218100488, "width": 165.93315556364237, "height": 30.969063043594215}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(54) MOBILE TERMINAL", "bbox": {"x": 215.36388117250667, "y": 334.58333331340583, "width": 316.1725067385445, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(75) Inventors:", "bbox": {"x": 210.7816690397575, "y": 412.49999965625, "width": 178.70619946091642, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Mao ASAI, Kawasaki-shi (JP);", "bbox": {"x": 448.5576392355804, "y": 408.26408727876856, "width": 321.82440744898713, "height": 36.751481691996226}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Shingo Sugimoto, Nagoya-shi (JP);", "bbox": {"x": 449.0566035412923, "y": 439.9999999809028, "width": 371.15902964959577, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Naoki Naruse, Yokohama-shi (JP);", "bbox": {"x": 449.05660329678744, "y": 467.4999999628378, "width": 361.99460916442047, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Hisashi Yoshinaga, Yokohama-shi", "bbox": {"x": 449.0566035414989, "y": 499.5833333184524, "width": 357.4123989218329, "height": 22.916666666666586}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(JP); Kumiko Yamaguchi, Yokosuka-shi (JP)", "bbox": {"x": 443.7995440513195, "y": 523.3455939435167, "width": 285.1335139930087, "height": 58.790281812349775}}, {"kind": "tex